    "name": "Effect: Sanguine Mutagen (Lesser)",
    "description": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Sanguine Mutagen (Lesser)]</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit</strong> You gain a +1 item bonus to Fortitude and Reflex saves. This bonus improves to +2 when you attempt a save against an effect that has the disease trait, poison trait, or would give you the Fatigued condition.</p>\n<p><strong>Drawback</strong> Whenever you take piercing or slashing damage, you take 1d6 bleed.</p>",
