    "description": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.South Wind's Scorch Song]</p>\n<p>You gain a +10-foot status bonus to your Speed until the end of your next turn. Your Strikes with this scimitar that deal fire damage gain a +2 status bonus to their fire damage. The status bonus increases to +3 if the weapon has a greater striking rune and +4 for major striking.</p><hr /><p><em>Note: the base +2 increase to damage is included in this effect. It cannot currently be made to automatically increase.</em></p>",
