    "name": "Stance: Clinging Shadows Stance",
    "description": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Clinging Shadows Stance]</p>\n<p>You can make shadow grasp Strikes. These deal 1d4 void damage; are in the brawling group; and have the agile, grapple, reach, and unarmed traits.</p>\n<p>While in the clinging shadows stance, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to Athletics checks to Grapple, and to the DC for creatures to Escape from you.</p>",
