    "name": "Spell Effect: Flame Dancer",
    "description": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Flame Dancer]</p>\n<p>The target's unarmed Strikes deal additional fire damage. Critical hits with these Strikes also deal persistent fire damage.</p>",
