    "name": "Spell Effect: Fire Shield",
    "description": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Fire Shield]</p>\n<p>You gain resistance to cold damage. You can Raise a Shield with the fire shield as a normal shield to gain a +1 circumstance bonus to AC.</p>",
