    "name": "Spell Effect: Undertow",
    "description": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Undertow]</p>\n<p>You take a –2 circumstance penalty to Athletics checks to Swim and a –10-foot circumstance penalty to your swim Speed, if you have one.</p>",
