    "name": "Spell Effect: Touch of the Moon",
    "description": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Touch of the Moon]</p>\n<p>You glow with dim light in a 20-foot radius. You also get a benefit based on a phase of the moon, starting with the new moon and changing to the next phase at the end of each of your turns.</p><ul><li><strong>New Moon</strong> You receive no benefit.</li><li><strong>Waxing Moon</strong> You gain a +1 status bonus to attack rolls and a +4 status bonus to damage rolls.</li><li><strong>Full Moon</strong> You gain a +1 status bonus to attack rolls, AC, and saves, and a +4 status bonus to damage.</li><li><strong>Waning Moon</strong> You gain a +1 status bonus to AC and saving throws. After this phase, return to the new moon.</li></ul>",
