    "name": "Spell Effect: Inspire Heroics (Defense, +2)",
    "description": "<p>Granted by succeeding on @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Fortissimo Composition] to enhance @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Rallying Anthem].</p>\n<p>You inspire your allies to protect themselves more effectively. You and all allies in the area gain a +2 status bonus to AC and saving throws, as well as resistance equal to half the spell's rank to physical damage.</p>\n<p><em>Note: resistance is not automatically added.</em></p>",
