    "description": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Clawsong]</p>\n<p>Your claw attack gains the versatile (piercing) trait, and deals 1d6 slashing damage. If your claw attack already deals 1d6 slashing damage, it deals 1d8 instead.</p>\n<p>If its claw attack already had the versatile (piercing) trait, it gains the deadly 1d8 trait.</p>",
