    "name": "Spell Effect: Anchoring Air",
    "description": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Anchoring Air]</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> You take a –2 circumstance penalty to the triggering melee Strike's attack roll.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> You take a –2 circumstance penalty to all attack rolls.</p>",
