    "name": "Spell Effect: Rallying Anthem",
    "description": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Rallying Anthem]</p>\n<p>You gain a +1 status bonus to AC and saving throws, as well as resistance equal to half the spell's rank to physical damage.</p>",
