    "description": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Benediction]</p>\n<p>You and your allies gain a +1 status bonus to AC while within the emanation. Once per round on subsequent turns, you can Sustain the spell to increase the emanation's radius by 10 feet.</p>",
