    "name": "Spell Effect: Competitive Edge",
    "description": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Competitive Edge]</p>\n<p>You gain a status bonus to attack rolls and skill checks. This bonus increases if an enemy critically succeeds at an attack roll or skill check.</p>",
