    "name": "Spell Effect: Distracting Decoy",
    "description": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Distracting Decoy]</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is off-guard until the start of your next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the creature also takes a –2 circumstance penalty to attacks while it's off-guard.</p>",
