    "name": "Spell Effect: Angelic Wings",
    "description": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Angelic Wings]</p>\n<p>You gain a fly Speed equal to your Speed. Your wings cast bright light in a 30-foot radius.</p>",
