    "name": "Aura: Angelic Halo",
    "description": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Angelic Halo]</p>\n<p>Allies in your halo's emanation who are healed by a <em>heal</em> spell gain a status bonus to Hit Points regained equal to double the <em>heal</em> spell's rank.</p>",
