    "name": "Spell Effect: Rite of Cleansing Flame (Failure)",
    "description": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Rite of Cleansing Flame]</p>\n<p>You gain weakness 5 to cold and unholy.</p>",
