    "name": "Spell Effect: Spirit of the Beast",
    "description": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Spirit of the Beast]</p>\n<p>Select from one of the following aspects.</p><ul><li><strong>Aspect of Might:</strong> You gain a status bonus to Athletics checks, Intimidation checks to Demoralize, and Fortitude saves.</li><li><strong>Aspect of Swiftness:</strong> You gain a status bonus to Acrobatics checks, Stealth checks to Hide or Sneak, and Reflex saves.</li><li><strong>Aspect of Insight:</strong> You gain a status bonus to Perception checks to Seek, Survival checks to Sense Direction or Track, and Will saves.</li></ul>",
