    "name": "Spell Effect: Scholarly Recollection",
    "description": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Scholarly Recollection]</p>\n<p>For your Perception check to Seek, or your skill check to Recall Knowledge with a skill you're trained in, you roll the triggering check twice and use the better result.</p>",
