    "name": "Spell Effect: Enlarge",
    "description": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Enlarge]</p>\n<p>You grow to size Large and are clumsy 1. Your reach increases by 5 feet (or by 10 feet if you started out Tiny), and you gain a +2 status bonus to melee damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> You grow to size Huge. The status bonus to melee damage is +4 and your reach increases by 10 feet (or 15 feet if you started out Tiny).</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> Choose either the 2nd-rank or 4th-rank version of this spell.</p>",
