    "name": "Spell Effect: See the Unseen",
    "description": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.See the Unseen]</p>\n<p>You can see invisible creatures as though they weren't invisible, although their features are blurred, making them @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Concealed] and difficult to identify. You also gain a +2 status bonus to checks you make to disbelieve illusions.</p>",
