    "name": "Spell Effect: Spirit Sense",
    "description": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Spirit Sense]</p>\n<p>You gain a +1 status bonus to the following checks regarding haunts or spirits: Perception checks to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Seek], attempts to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Recall Knowledge], skill checks to determine the reason for their existence, and skill checks to disable a haunt. You also gain a +1 status bonus to AC and saving throws against haunts and spirits.</p>",
