    "name": "Spell Effect: Manifest Will",
    "description": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Manifest Will]</p>\n<p>You gain an effect depending on the spell's tradition, or the tradition selected with Multifaceted Will.</p><ul><li><strong>Arcane</strong> You gain weakness to spell damage equal to the spell's rank.</li><li><strong>Divine</strong> You gain temporary Hit Points equal to twice the spell's rank.</li><li><strong>Occult</strong> You gain lesser cover.</li><li><strong>Primal</strong> You have a –10-foot status penalty to all your Speeds.</li></ul>",
