    "name": "Spell Effect: Pest Form",
    "description": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Pest Form]</p>\n<p>You transform into the battle form of a Tiny animal. While in this form, you gain the animal trait and you can't make Strikes. You gain the following statistics and abilities:</p><ul><li>AC = 15 + your level. Ignore your armor's check penalty and Speed reduction.</li><li>Speed 20 feet.</li><li>Weakness 5 to physical damage. (If you take physical damage in this form, you take 5 additional damage.)</li><li>Low-light vision and imprecise scent 30 feet.</li><li>Acrobatics and Stealth modifiers of +10, unless your own modifier is higher; Athletics modifier -4.</li></ul><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> You can turn into a flying creature, such as a bird, which grants you a fly Speed of 20 feet.</p>",
